## 2. Message Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Channel
    participant G as Gateway
    participant B as MessageBus
    participant A as AgentLoop
    participant T as Tools
    participant P as LLM Provider
    participant O as Outbound Channel

    U->>C: Send Message
    C->>G: Inbound Message
    G->>B: PublishInbound()
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        note right of B: Agent Processing Loop
        loop While Tool Calls Exist
            B->>A: ConsumeInbound()
            A->>A: Handle Commands
            
            alt Requires LLM
                A->>P: Chat()
                P-->>A: Response
                A->>T: Execute Tools
                T-->>A: Tool Result
                A->>P: Continue Chat
            end
        end
    end
    
    A->>B: PublishOutbound()
    B->>O: Send Response
    O-->>U: Display
```

